---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact | Kvisl" description="Official contact routes for Kvisl.">
  <main class="container page-main narrow-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Contact</h1>

    <div class="policy-copy">
      <p>Use official <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> channels for editorial enquiries, rights, republication, privacy requests, corrections, and collaboration.</p>

      <h2>Republication</h2>
      <p>Use the <a href="/republish">Republish</a> request form for licensing enquiries. Republication requires written permission and a paid licence before publication.</p>

      <h2>Privacy and rights</h2>
      <p>For privacy, copyright, or correction requests, identify the relevant page or article and include enough detail for us to understand and verify the request.</p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>Do not send passwords, wallet private keys, seed phrases, or other sensitive credentials. <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> will never ask you to send those credentials through a form, direct message, or email.</p>

      <h2>Official channels</h2>
      <p>A public editorial email address will be published here when it is ready. Until then, rely only on contact links published on this website and do not send payments or confidential material to accounts claiming to represent <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
